        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-20T20:07:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t see any reason why android_test_import modules shouldn\u0027t support `test_config` or `test_config_template` options, maybe it would be better to implement them?",
      "revId": "2f83b31af7b4d33a45c0c6c2dc915f8ab0d1feba",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5a3c83d9_3bbccd9a",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-21T00:02:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Wouldn\u0027t it be a breaking change to the existing android_test_import modules?\n\nIf they have AndroidTest.xml in the directory, the file will suddenly be used, causing them to turn into a test.\n\nIf they don\u0027t have Androidtest.xml in the directory, the build will fail because the build system will try to use the file. (we can avoid this by not wanting the file when it doesn\u0027t exist, then the semantic of test_config becomes different from other modules. Are you okay with that?)\n\nIt looks like the intended use of android_test_import is to have a prebuilt apk as an additional apk that (another) test uses. Those prebuilt apks are NOT the entry point to the test.",
      "parentUuid": "d6178c6b_ed48055d",
      "revId": "2f83b31af7b4d33a45c0c6c2dc915f8ab0d1feba",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e674756c_a34a2113",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-21T19:07:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That sounds like we need an `android_test_helper_app_import` for that use case so that an `android_test_import` can be used as a test.  I\u0027m not sure if there are any remaining uses of `android_test_import` if we add `android_test_helper_app_import` though.",
      "parentUuid": "5a3c83d9_3bbccd9a",
      "revId": "2f83b31af7b4d33a45c0c6c2dc915f8ab0d1feba",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e0e9bd59_2549d90a",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-23T08:28:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I agree with you that the name android_test_import is somewhat misleading and I don\u0027t think there is a need for a build rule for converting a prebuilt into a test.\n\nI can take the renamining of the module type if you agree, but that should be as a follow-up change I think.",
      "parentUuid": "e674756c_a34a2113",
      "revId": "2f83b31af7b4d33a45c0c6c2dc915f8ab0d1feba",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8423d533_8dbbe9e8",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-27T22:51:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d suggest leaving this module as-is, adding a new `android_test_helper_app_import` and then moving the existing uses over to the new module type, and then deciding whether we should add `test_config` support to `android_test_import` or remove `android_test_import`, but you can also do it as a rename if you prefer.",
      "parentUuid": "e0e9bd59_2549d90a",
      "revId": "2f83b31af7b4d33a45c0c6c2dc915f8ab0d1feba",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
